    <panel_attributes>title=SD04 - Adapt Meal Plan After a Pantry or Constraint Change   (UC02, UC09; F02, F09, F11, F12, F13)\nThe page calls the facade in-process; the Home check-up (N02), the CLI and the assistant reach the same adaptPlan operation
obj=Meal Planner~U ACTOR
obj=:MealPlanningGUI\n(Pantry and Meal plan pages)~GUI
obj=:MealPlanningFacade~F
obj=:PantryService~PS
obj=pantry:Pantry~P
obj=:PantryRepository~PR
obj=:GroceryListImpactObserver~GLO
obj=:GroceryService~GS
obj=:MealPlanImpactObserver~MPO
obj=:MealPlanService~MPS
obj=:PlanImpactAssessor~PIA
obj=:PlanImpactRepository~PIR
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:MealPlanningAgent~AG
obj=:ProviderLLMAdapter\n«LLMClient»~LLM
obj=:ConstraintValidator~CV

U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 1: "eggs, 0" (ran out)
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 2: matchIngredients("eggs"); on=F
F.&gt;GUI : 3: egg (one match, a general\nname such as "beef" lists kinds); off=F
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 4: updatePantry(profileId,\nitem); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS : 5: updateItem(profileId,\nitem); on=PS
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;P : 6: updateItem(item)
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR : 7: save(pantry)
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS + : 8:\npublish(event)
tick=1
text=PS:event = PlanRelevantChange\n(PANTRY_CHANGED)
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GLO : 9: onPlanRelevantChange(event); on=GLO
GLO-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS : 10: markAffectedListStale(\nevent)
off=GLO
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPO : 11: onPlanRelevantChange(event); on=MPO
MPO-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 12: getActivePlan(profileId); on=MPS
MPS.&gt;MPO : 13: plan; off=MPS
MPO-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 14: assessImpact(plan,\nevent); on=MPS
MPS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PIA : 15: assess(plan, cause list); on=PIA
PIA.&gt;MPS : 16: PlanImpact (meals that\nuse eggs); off=PIA
MPS.&gt;MPO : 17: PlanImpact; off=MPS
MPO-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 18: recordImpact(plan,\nimpact); on=MPS
MPS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PIR : 19: record(planId, cause)\nif the impact is not empty
off=MPS
off=MPO
text=MPO:no LLM call inside the event:\nthe pantry update returns at once
PS.&gt;F : 20: updated Pantry; off=PS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 21: getPendingImpact(planId); on=MPS
MPS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PIA : 22: assess(plan, recorded causes); on=PIA
PIA.&gt;MPS : 23: PlanImpact (recomputed from\nthe current state); off=PIA
MPS.&gt;F : 24: PlanImpact; off=MPS
F.&gt;GUI : 25: AgentResponse(SUCCESS,\nconflicts); off=F
GUI.&gt;U : 26: "This affects your meal plan",\nthe plan page shows the same notice
combinedFragment=opt~P U CV; GUI:[user chooses "Let the agent adapt it" (the pantry banner and the Home check-up send the same request through the assistant)]
U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 27: Let the agent adapt it
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 28: adaptPlan(profileId); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 29: getPendingImpact(planId); on=MPS
MPS.&gt;F : 30: PlanImpact; off=MPS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 31: adaptPlan(plan, impact); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 32: proposeAdaptation(\ncontext, impact); on=AG
combinedFragment=loop~T AG LLM; MPS:[tool loop as in SD01, then one plan_change answer]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 33: generateStructured(prompt, schema, INSTRUCTIONS); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 34: recipeSearch call, finish, or replacements; off=LLM
--=T
AG.&gt;AC : 35: ChangeAttempt (affected\nmeals only); off=AG
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 36: validateChange(change, context); on=CV
CV.&gt;AC : 37: ValidationResult; off=CV
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC + : 38:\nhold in\npendingChanges
tick=1
AC.&gt;F : 39: AgentResponse(NEEDS_CONFIRMATION or CONFLICT); off=AC
F.&gt;GUI : 40: proposed changes; off=F
GUI.&gt;U : 41: preview of adapted\nmeals
combinedFragment=alt~A U CV; GUI:[user applies]
U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 42: Apply
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 43: executeChange(planId,\nchange)
text=F:continues as in SD03:\nconfirmChange, executeChange,\nrefreshForPlan (list refreshed)
..=A; GUI:[no feasible adaptation, or user declines]
text=GUI:current plan kept, the impact\nstays pending and is shown\nagain on the Home check-up
--=A
--=P
text=GUI:ProfileService.updateProfile()\npublishes PROFILE_CHANGED,\nBUDGET_CHANGED, or\nTIME_LIMIT_CHANGED through\nthe same observers</panel_attributes>
